WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.151 --> 00:00:04.260
I think you are good with, uh...

00:00:04.584 --> 00:00:06.752
[drum Rolls]

00:00:06.752 --> 00:00:07.585
People.

00:00:07.585 --> 00:00:08.661
Why is it taking you so long?
[Ray laughs]

00:00:08.661 --> 00:00:12.570
(playful jazz music)

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:13.403
The Big Sick.

00:00:13.403 --> 00:00:15.455
I'm a stand-up comedian, I fall
in love with a white woman,

00:00:15.455 --> 00:00:16.644
she gets sick, and then you're--

00:00:16.644 --> 00:00:17.477
I'm her father.

00:00:17.477 --> 00:00:19.148
Yeah, and you come and
visit and we hang out.

00:00:19.148 --> 00:00:21.269
I think if I give Ray a compliment,

00:00:21.269 --> 00:00:23.103
you're very good at turning it around

00:00:23.103 --> 00:00:25.148
and making it--

00:00:25.148 --> 00:00:26.046
[Ray] A negative?

00:00:26.046 --> 00:00:26.957
Yeah.

00:00:26.957 --> 00:00:28.729
I personally am not good at taking--

00:00:28.729 --> 00:00:30.045
[Kumail] Me neither.

00:00:30.045 --> 00:00:30.977
Or giving.

00:00:30.977 --> 00:00:33.565
But we can try giving compliments.

00:00:33.565 --> 00:00:34.771
I like your glasses.

00:00:34.771 --> 00:00:38.012
I don't like shoes, but those don't suck.

00:00:38.012 --> 00:00:40.013
You don't like shoes?

00:00:40.013 --> 00:00:42.459
My wife Emily, any time she sees the movie

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:46.626
keeps talking about how handsome you are.

00:00:47.391 --> 00:00:50.196
I really don't, I feel mixed about it.

00:00:50.196 --> 00:00:53.047
Are you mixed about it because
you're a little jealous,

00:00:53.047 --> 00:00:54.350
or are you mixed about it because,

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:56.798
"If she thinks he's handsome..."

00:00:56.798 --> 00:00:59.402
[Kumail laughs]

00:00:59.402 --> 00:01:02.874
Your kids are all very nice
and, like, good people,

00:01:02.874 --> 00:01:04.093
and, like, grounded.

00:01:04.093 --> 00:01:05.230
Thank you very much, but also,

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:08.037
my kids told me to do this movie

00:01:08.037 --> 00:01:09.479
when they heard you were in it.

00:01:09.479 --> 00:01:11.897
I saw edits of the movie before he did,

00:01:11.897 --> 00:01:14.127
so I would just text him and
tell him how funny he was

00:01:14.127 --> 00:01:15.229
in the movie.

00:01:15.229 --> 00:01:17.258
Usually also when I text you about

00:01:17.258 --> 00:01:20.234
how insecure I am about something,

00:01:20.234 --> 00:01:21.925
like, "Oh, like they're
gonna hate me in this,"

00:01:21.925 --> 00:01:24.296
you would text back,
"Someone with your talent

00:01:24.296 --> 00:01:26.417
is that insecure."

00:01:26.417 --> 00:01:27.678
So it was like a--

00:01:27.678 --> 00:01:30.011
It was actually inspiring.

00:01:31.811 --> 00:01:32.865
Therapeutic.

00:01:32.865 --> 00:01:33.953
- Oh yeah?
- It was therapeutic.

00:01:33.953 --> 00:01:34.787
Yeah.

00:01:34.787 --> 00:01:35.841
Because I'm not good at it,

00:01:35.841 --> 00:01:38.975
and it's also good that, you know,

00:01:38.975 --> 00:01:42.285
we truly do respect and like each other.

00:01:42.285 --> 00:01:45.423
I felt kind of awkward because
I really, really like Ray,

00:01:45.423 --> 00:01:48.151
and we text each other
nice stuff about each other

00:01:48.151 --> 00:01:48.984
all the time,

00:01:48.984 --> 00:01:49.870
but doing it face to face while he's here

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:53.559
and me telling him, "I think
your eyes are so soulful--"

00:01:53.559 --> 00:01:54.427
It's awkward.

00:01:54.427 --> 00:01:55.991
[laughs] Yeah, that's the word.

00:01:55.991 --> 00:01:57.930
The erection threw me.

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:01.946
It's a nervous erection, calm down.

00:02:02.363 --> 00:02:03.510
[Ray laughs]

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:05.029
This happens whenever I
don't know what to do.

00:02:05.029 --> 00:02:08.196
See The Big Sick everywhere July 14th.

